<title>USA: Morgan's Foods to buy back 1.0 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Morgan's Foods to buy back 1.0 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>BEACHWOOD, Ohio 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan's Foods Inc said Wednesday its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 1.0 million of the company's common shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be bought in the open market from time to time, the company said.</p>
<p>Morgan's Foods operates 39 KFC restaurants in five states and six East Side Mario's in Cleveland/Akron and Columbus, Ohio.</p>
